        "models_reported": [
          "claude-opus-5-5"
        ],
        "note": "These verses describe the hot baths of Aix-la-Chapelle (Aachen). A sidenote in the preceding paragraph points to Lodovico Guicciardini's Description of Germany, in the section on Aachen, but the author of the verses is not named.",
